{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tails &amp; Talons is a roguelite deckbuilder where <i>spell-casting cards</i> and <i>card-matching combos</i> intertwine to create an addicting and strategic experience! Join a colorful cast of furry adventurers, unleash powerful spells, and chain devastating combos as you descend down a mysterious tower..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/cef7fb3ad563c5581ff1cc10f941ca50.avif?t=1766578536\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras_big/cef7fb3ad563c5581ff1cc10f941ca50.avif?t=1766578536 width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match up elements and runes to rack up bigger numbers when you attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/e158c04000aa6314ca2152411d6e4004.poster.avif?t=1766578536\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/e158c04000aa6314ca2152411d6e4004.webm?t=1766578536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/e158c04000aa6314ca2152411d6e4004.mp4?t=1766578536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/3090a7527d1a47bf5436be647163c7e2.avif?t=1766578536\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras_big/3090a7527d1a47bf5436be647163c7e2.avif?t=1766578536 width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matching-combos aren\u2019t the only way to hit hard \u2013 fill your deck with spells and discover trinkets that synergise with your strategy to grow your power exponentially!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/43919dea2a45acd7a0ee2e030f432bc3.poster.avif?t=1766578536\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/43919dea2a45acd7a0ee2e030f432bc3.webm?t=1766578536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/43919dea2a45acd7a0ee2e030f432bc3.mp4?t=1766578536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/94c9f39a2d0cb1b040d2f491eed349b3.avif?t=1766578536\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras_big/94c9f39a2d0cb1b040d2f491eed349b3.avif?t=1766578536 width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a mysterious underground tower and face its increasingly twisted inhabitants.\u00a0Uncover its forbidden knowledge by documenting creatures, relics, and spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/da231f19a29d8c222e473de148422a2b.poster.avif?t=1766578536\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/da231f19a29d8c222e473de148422a2b.webm?t=1766578536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/da231f19a29d8c222e473de148422a2b.mp4?t=1766578536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/dd73c0753f3463074893ad8f6d2d5059.avif?t=1766578536\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras_big/dd73c0753f3463074893ad8f6d2d5059.avif?t=1766578536 width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each furry hero has a focus on different strategies for you to explore as you make your runs down into the dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/cf23e6ed14e1242de6d3c474501daa7b.poster.avif?t=1766578536\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/cf23e6ed14e1242de6d3c474501daa7b.webm?t=1766578536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/cf23e6ed14e1242de6d3c474501daa7b.mp4?t=1766578536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667460?t=1766578536","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/50e777e53cbf0f09d429c12c9d2c13cb2f8d9f59/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766578536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/8605ad74b6ccbfb661c1eee961ada1e76